        <details>These images correspond to the unprocessed multi-frame micrographs of three data collections on independent biological and protein isolation replicates of partially purified Tetrahymena mitochondrial respiratory chain complexes. The data were collected on a 200 kV TFS Glacios microscope using a Gatan K3 detector in super-resolution mode. The gain references are also included: SuperRef_lz_tt_bottom_001_Sep18.dm4/mrc corresponds to the data collected on September18-19 (Sep18/19 in image name) and gain.mrc corresponds to the data collected on October02-04 (Oct02/03/04 in image name).</details>
